# Everything not listed with a leading ! is left out of the packaged extension.
# The bundles in dist/ hold all the code, so the source and tests stay behind:
# the extension, and the Workflow Wizard's page with its stylesheet.
**
!dist/extension.cjs
!dist/wizard.js
!dist/wizard.css
!media/**
!package.json
!README.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
